# World settings

option.WAVING_PLANTS                   = Waving Plants
option.WAVING_PLANTS.comment             = Ground plants wave in the wind.

To make a block wave, add it to category 10016, 10017 or 10018 in shaders/block.properties
option.WAVING_LEAVES                   = Waving Leaves
option.WAVING_LEAVES.comment             = Leaf blocks wave in the wind.

To make a block wave, add it to category 10019 in shaders/block.properties
