option.COLORED_LIGHTS                  = Colored Lights
option.COLORED_LIGHTS.comment          = Variable-color block lighting using flood fill algorithm. Requires Iris 1.6 or above
option.HANDHELD_LIGHTING_MODE          = Handheld Lighting
option.HANDHELD_LIGHTING_MODE.comment    = Light cast by held items. Off disables it. Normal uses the vanilla blocklight color scaled by the item's light level. Colored uses per-block emissive colors
value.HANDHELD_LIGHTING_MODE.HANDHELD_LIGHTING_OFF    = Off
value.HANDHELD_LIGHTING_MODE.HANDHELD_LIGHTING_NORMAL = Normal
value.HANDHELD_LIGHTING_MODE.HANDHELD_LIGHTING_COLORED = Colored
option.HANDHELD_LIGHTING_INTENSITY     = Handheld Lighting Intensity
option.HANDHELD_LIGHTING_INTENSITY.comment = Adjusts the brightness of handheld light sources
option.CLOUD_SHADOWS                   = Cloud Shadows
option.CLOUD_SHADOWS.comment           = Shadows cast by clouds on the ground
option.CLOUD_SHADOWS_INTENSITY         = Cloud Shadows Intensity
option.CLOUD_SHADOWS_INTENSITY.comment = Adjusts the intensity of cloud shadows
option.IBL                              = Image Based Lighting
option.IBL.comment                       = Master toggle for image-based lighting: shadowed surfaces are lit by the sky map, both diffuse ambient and sky reflections. See include/lighting/ibl.glsl for details
option.IBL_INTENSITY                    = IBL Diffuse Intensity
option.IBL_INTENSITY.comment             = Scales the diffuse sky ambient contribution. 1.0 is physically correct; lower values darken sky-lit shadowed areas
option.IBL_SAMPLES                      = IBL Diffuse Samples
option.IBL_SAMPLES.comment               = Sky map samples used for diffuse ambient lighting. More samples capture more sky detail but cost performance; TAA converges the noise over frames
option.IBL_SPECULAR_INTENSITY           = IBL Specular Intensity
option.IBL_SPECULAR_INTENSITY.comment    = Scales the sky reflection contribution. 1.0 is physically correct; lower values give subtler reflections. Only active when the IBL master toggle is on
option.IBL_SPECULAR_SAMPLES             = IBL Specular Samples
option.IBL_SPECULAR_SAMPLES.comment      = Rays traced against the sky for reflections when screen-space reflections are off. 1 uses a fast mirror path; more samples give cleaner rough reflections
option.POROSITY                        = Porosity
option.POROSITY.comment                = Materials darken when wet, based on the porosity value in the resource pack's labPBR textures
option.POROSITY_STRENGTH               = Porosity Strength
option.POROSITY_STRENGTH.comment       = Adjusts how strongly porosity darkens materials when wet
option.SUB_SURFACE_SCATTERING          = Sub-Surface Scattering
option.SUB_SURFACE_SCATTERING.comment  = Simulates light passing through thin materials such as leaves, based on the resource pack's labPBR textures
option.SSS_SHEEN                       = SSS Sheen
option.SSS_SHEEN.comment               = Specular "sheen" effect on plants and leaves, helps tall grass and stuff to blend better with the grass specular
option.SSS_SHEEN_INTENSITY             = SSS Sheen Intensity
option.SSS_SHEEN_INTENSITY.comment     = Adjusts the strength of the specular sheen effect
option.SSS_INTENSITY                   = SSS Intensity
option.SSS_INTENSITY.comment           = Adjusts the brightness of subsurface scattering (SSS)
option.SHADING_STRENGTH                = Shading Strength
option.SHADING_STRENGTH.comment          = Contrast of direct light shading. Lower values brighten faces turned away from the sun; higher values darken them

